{"id":443,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It nests in caves untouched by sunlight. Its sharp teeth may fall out when worn away or after an impact, but they regrow within a few days."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Gible attacks anything that moves, and it drags whatever it catches into the crevice that is its lair. Despite the big mouth, Gible’s stomach is small."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Gible prefers to stay in narrow holes in the sides of caves heated by geothermal energy. This way, Gible can stay warm even during a blizzard."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its original home is an area much hotter than Alola. If you’re planning to live with one, your heating bill will soar."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It reacts to anything that moves—flies right at it and bites it. Sometimes it injures itself, but it doesn’t care too much."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat. Even so, when the weather gets cold, it will huddle close with others of its kind."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It once lived in the tropics. To avoid the cold, it lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."},{"name":"Rough Skin","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's rough skin damages attackers that make direct contact with it."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":443,"name":"Gible","condition":null,"children":[{"id":444,"name":"Gabite","condition":"Lv. 24","children":[{"id":445,"name":"Garchomp","condition":"Lv. 48","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,328],[6,28],[12,225],[18,523],[25,44],[30,163],[36,337],[42,91],[48,201],[54,36],[60,407]],"machine":[34,523,91,38,434,913,337,406,525,414,89,203,263,206,126,424,53,270,442,232,341,200,182,240,156,157,317,328,201,799,184,815,421,214,446,444,164,241,129,14,36,851,422],"egg":[38,232,37,239],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-109","name":"Cynthia's Gible","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"109","artist":"Tomomi Ozaki","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-109/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-109/large"},{"id":"sv10-102","name":"Cynthia's Gible","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Common","number":"102","artist":null,"img":"sv10/102"},{"id":"sv4-94","name":"Gible","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"94","artist":"saino misaki","img":"sv4/94"},{"id":"swsh9-107","name":"Gible","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Common","number":"107","artist":"sowsow","img":"swsh9/107"},{"id":"sma-SV38","name":"Gible","set":"Hidden Fates Shiny Vault","date":"2019-08-23","rarity":"Rare Shiny","number":"SV38","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","img":"sma/SV38"},{"id":"sm11-112","name":"Gible","set":"Unified Minds","date":"2019-08-02","rarity":"Common","number":"112","artist":"Asako Ito","img":"sm11/112"},{"id":"sm6-60","name":"Gible","set":"Forbidden Light","date":"2018-05-04","rarity":"Common","number":"60","artist":"Kyoko Umemoto","img":"sm6/60"},{"id":"sm5-96","name":"Gible","set":"Ultra Prism","date":"2018-